{
  "version": "2.4.2",
  "published_at": "2026-10-22T11:00:00+08:00",
  "download_url": "https://github.com/yakrsa/MiteProxy/releases/latest",
  "changes": [
    {
      "zh": "新增「两条会话对比」：流量列表里**多选两条**右键「对比两条会话」，并排看方法 / URL / 状态 / headers 差异，body 走键级 diff（JSON）或行级 diff（文本），二进制只报同/不同——不用先重放就能比线上与本地",
      "en": "New \"Compare two sessions\": select exactly two flows in the list and right-click \"Compare two sessions\" to see method / URL / status / headers side by side; bodies go through key-level diff (JSON) or line-level diff (text), and binaries only report same/different — no replay needed to compare live vs local"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增列显隐与自定义列：表头右键勾选显示/隐藏列，**内容类型 / 开始时刻 / 备注** 三个可选列默认隐藏；显隐状态随设置持久化（按列 key 存，以后加列不会错位）",
      "en": "New column show/hide and custom columns: right-click the header to toggle columns; the three optional columns content-type / start time / comment are hidden by default, and the visibility state persists in settings (keyed by column key, so adding columns later won't shift saved state)"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增多套过滤预设：工具栏过滤栏可把当前过滤条件存为「预设」并命名，一键切换 / 删除；设置里记录激活的预设，启动自动套用",
      "en": "New filter presets: the toolbar filter bar can save the current filter as a named preset and switch/delete with one click; settings remember the active preset and apply it on launch"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增 SSE 流式响应展示：body 视图自动识别 `text/event-stream`，把逐条 `event / data / id / retry` 事件拆开渲染，便于看 Server-Sent Events 流",
      "en": "New SSE streaming view: the body view auto-detects text/event-stream and renders each event (event / data / id / retry) separately, making Server-Sent Events streams readable"
    },
    {
      "zh": "MCP 接口新增写操作（默认关，需手动开）：`add_mock_rule`（加 Mock 规则）/ `replay_flow`（重放某条会话）/ `set_breakpoint`（设断点）；没开写操作时工具列表不暴露、调用直接拒绝，保证默认只读安全",
      "en": "MCP now exposes write operations (off by default, opt-in): add_mock_rule / replay_flow / set_breakpoint; with writes disabled the tools are hidden from the tool list and calls are rejected, keeping the default read-only posture safe"
    },
    {
      "zh": "新增用户脚本（插件）：`~/.miteproxy/scripts/*.py` 里写 mitmproxy 风格的 flow 钩子（模块级函数或 Addon 类，支持可选 `ctx` 第一参），在「脚本」页增删改 / 启停，保存后**热替换**无需重启代理；单个脚本报错被隔离，不拖垮其他脚本与代理主流程",
      "en": "New user scripts (plugins): write mitmproxy-style flow hooks in ~/.miteproxy/scripts/*.py (module-level functions or an Addon class, with an optional ctx first argument), manage and toggle them from the Scripts tab, and hot-reload on save without restarting the proxy; a broken script is isolated and won't take down other scripts or the proxy"
    },
    {
      "zh": "大流量长跑稳定性：列表与缓存都有 5000 条硬上限，喂超量流量后行数/缓存条数精确裁到上限、内存不会随抓包时长无限增长；统计聚合在满容量下仍远低于 1 秒",
      "en": "Large-capture long-run stability: both the list and the cache are hard-capped at 5000 entries, so feeding excess traffic trims rows/cache precisely to the cap and memory no longer grows unbounded over long captures; stats aggregation stays well under 1 second even at full capacity"
    }
  ]
}
